 "note": "Thomas C. Passios Elementary School. Lines 1-10 continue the Passios narrative from page 42 (its School Council list and a retirement note); line 11 heads 'ELEMENTARY SCHOOL FACULTY and STAFF', and Cynthia Daukantas, Passios principal, heads it. Lines 1-6 are the School Council for 2002-2003 (a governance body including parents), kept as entries with grade_or_dept 'School Council' so they can be filtered; line 5 prints 'Community Representative: open' -- no person -- and is ignored. Lines 7-10 are narrative, 47 the page number. Layout: two columns, each a label and a name (Textract x 0.03/0.15 and 0.39/0.57 or similar). The left-column office labels (Principal, Asst. Prin., Adm. Sec., Guidance, Nurse) are titles and go in role_raw; the grade labels (Preschool, Kindergarten, Grade 1-4) and every right-column label (Learning Center, Art, Cafeteria, Custodians ...) are section labels governing the names below them and go in grade_or_dept. A cell printing two names with '/' is two entries. '(Pri.)' after a name is kept in role_raw as printed (it marks the Primary School). Line 15's Denise Fjeld '(parti-time)' is under Adm. Sec.; line 18's Sharon Massle / Katie McGuire continue the Nurse block. Honorifics printed before names (Mr., Mrs., Ms., Dr.) are not carried in `name`."
